Word list license: pt-BR (Português (Brasil))
=============================================

The files words.txt and words-ascii.txt in this folder are made from the sources below.
Hekate changed this source. Hekate filtered the words and shortened the list.
The license of each source applies to the words that come from that source.

This list is a copyleft work. It keeps the license of VERO pt_BR (Hunspell, LibreOffice dictionaries) (MPL). Every changed copy of the list must use that license too.

Sources
-------

1. ParlaIbero-BR: Parliamentary Speeches from Brazil (2003-2025), speeches from 2009 or later (version: 2 (released 2026-09-07), role: frequency)
   License: CC BY 4.0
   License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Home page: https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/VTXNW3

2. VERO pt_BR (Hunspell, LibreOffice dictionaries) (version: commit 32b006a2c22a4ac7e8ed3f03346f7b3d85a970a4, role: lexicon)
   License: MPL
   License text: https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/MPL/
   Home page: https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries/tree/master/pt_BR

